keyd-belgian-windows (0.9.4) noble; urgency=medium

  * No change in this package. 0.9.4 ships with keyd 2.5.0-5~ubuntu24.04.2,
    which carries this project's patch "Keep AltGr held while a Ctrl+Alt
    layer is held" (fewer swapped characters with ibus at very fast
    Ctrl+Alt typing). The rules work with an unpatched keyd as before.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:30:00 +0000

